+    /// Between the accept and the cut the window shows the completed word (D33); at the deadline every view returns to the pre-image, in the same step that stops the machine.
+    /// The CPU's data read (Region::Xip, Region::XipFlash), instruction fetch and the raw array the JIT reads are checked.
+    #[test]
